\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces High-Level Model Architecture. The encoder and decoder work together to incrementally remove energy from the input representation, an STFT-based magnitude spectrogram, in our case. At each step, the encoder produces a single event vector and time-of-occurrence. The decoder generates an audio event, ``schedules'' it, and subtracts it from the input representation.}}{2}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:model_architecture}{{2}{2}{High-Level Model Architecture. The encoder and decoder work together to incrementally remove energy from the input representation, an STFT-based magnitude spectrogram, in our case. At each step, the encoder produces a single event vector and time-of-occurrence. The decoder generates an audio event, ``schedules'' it, and subtracts it from the input representation}{figure.2}{}}
