\newlabel{fig:event_detail}{{5}{4}{Here we can see intermediate stages of the source-excitation-based decoder at work. From left to right, we see A. a spectrogram of the initial noisy impulse B. a spectogram of the noisy impulse convolved with the chosen decaying resonance and C. the result from step B. convolved with a room impulse response}{figure.5}{}}
